// The Quiet Reach: the survey expedition, on a hilltop just south of the
// Commons, up the elevator from its south fence (it arrives on the north rim). Safe
// everywhere (zone "safe"): no enemies, no death. Three gentle puzzles open
// the way: a broken bridge over the gorge (mend it with scrap at the winch),
// a blast door into the fungal cavern (gas at the valve), and a rock face
// that's only a projection (scan the projector). Five landmarks to scan, and
// three kinds of specimen, one behind each puzzle.

name: The Quiet Reach
spawn: none
ground: grass
zone safe: 0,0 55,43

